# 系統通知 documentation

Whenever you create, change, or remove a notification — email, WhatsApp, or an in-app system notification — update `#settings/system-notifications` in the same change so the page stays the current record.

## Where to edit

- Catalog: `src/lib/systemNotifications.ts` (`buildSystemNotificationCatalog`)
- Page: `#settings/system-notifications` (`src/components/settings/SystemNotificationsSettings.tsx` only if the layout needs a new field)
- Checks: `scripts/run-system-notifications-test.ts`

## Each entry must match the live send

- Name, subject, purpose, and what triggers the send
- Kind: `scheduled` or `manual`
- Frequency for scheduled sends, in Hong Kong time, including the cron expression. Manual sends say there is no fixed schedule.
- To, Cc, and Bcc. Write 無 when a field is unused. Dynamic recipients get a short summary plus who is included.
- HTML preview rendered from the real template (sample data is fine). Do not invent a second template for the page.

The 電郵連接 connection-test message is not a notification. Leave it off this page.
